    "Before release, the hosted privacy policy must identify the service operator and its retention practices. Until that owner gate is complete, the hosted policy link remains unavailable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before release, the hosted privacy policy must identify the service operator and its retention practices. Until that owner gate is complete, the hosted policy link remains unavailable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes del lanzamiento, la política de privacidad alojada debe identificar al operador del servicio y sus prácticas de conservación. Hasta completar esa revisión del propietario, el enlace a la política alojada seguirá sin estar disponible."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "До выпуска опубликованная политика конфиденциальности должна указывать оператора сервиса и правила хранения данных. Пока владелец не завершит эту проверку, ссылка на политику будет недоступна."
